{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"const assetPathPrefix = \"https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/5ec44ab7-d146-42a4-9139-c07f24494a75\";\nconst imgHeader = `${assetPathPrefix}/aa689.svg`;\n\nexport default function Auth03() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"bg-[#f0efeb] relative size-full\" data-node-id=\"487:615\" data-name=\"AUTH 03 · Подтверждение почты / Код\">\n      <div className=\"-translate-x-1/2 absolute h-[100px] left-[calc(50%-0.21px)] top-0 w-[397.572px]\" data-node-id=\"487:644\" data-name=\"HEADER / Фон\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgHeader} />\n      </div>\n      <p className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] leading-[normal] left-1/2 not-italic text-[16px] text-black text-center top-[67px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"487:648\">\n        подтвердить почту\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] leading-[normal] left-[30px] not-italic text-[20px] text-black top-[153px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"487:649\">\n        введите код из письма\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[30px] not-italic text-[#a5a5a5] text-[13px] top-[190px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"487:650\">\n        Мы отправили 6-значный код на вашу почту.\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-white h-[56px] left-[30px] rounded-[6px] top-[255px] w-[45px]\" data-node-id=\"487:651\" data-name=\"Ячейка кода / 1\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-white h-[56px] left-[87px] rounded-[6px] top-[255px] w-[45px]\" data-node-id=\"487:652\" data-name=\"Ячейка кода / 2\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-white h-[56px] left-[144px] rounded-[6px] top-[255px] w-[45px]\" data-node-id=\"487:653\" data-name=\"Ячейка кода / 3\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-white h-[56px] left-[201px] rounded-[6px] top-[255px] w-[45px]\" data-node-id=\"487:654\" data-name=\"Ячейка кода / 4\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-white h-[56px] left-[258px] rounded-[6px] top-[255px] w-[45px]\" data-node-id=\"487:655\" data-name=\"Ячейка кода / 5\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-white h-[56px] left-[315px] rounded-[6px] top-[255px] w-[45px]\" data-node-id=\"487:656\" data-name=\"Ячейка кода / 6\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[#48352d] h-[48px] left-[30px] rounded-[24px] top-[351px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"487:657\" data-name=\"Кнопка / подтвердить\" />\n      <p className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[195px] not-italic text-[16px] text-center text-white top-[365px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"487:658\">\n        подтвердить\n      </p>\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[48px] left-[30px] top-[351px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"487:659\" data-name=\"FLOW / подтвердить\" />\n      <button className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute block cursor-pointer font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[0] left-[195px] not-italic text-[#48352d] text-[13px] text-center top-[422px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"487:660\">\n        <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">отправить код ещё раз</p>\n      </button>\n      <a className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute block cursor-pointer font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[0] left-[195px] not-italic text-[#a5a5a5] text-[13px] text-center top-[459px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"487:661\">\n        <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">изменить почту</p>\n      </a>\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer left-[18px] size-[42px] top-[53px]\" data-node-id=\"488:620\" data-name=\"FLOW / Назад\">\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] leading-[normal] left-[12px] not-italic text-[30px] text-black text-left top-0 whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"488:621\">\n          ‹\n        </p>\n      </a>\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[56px] left-[30px] top-[255px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"494:678\" data-name=\"PROTO / Ввод кода\" />\n    </div>\n  );\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"SUPER CRITICAL: The generated React+Tailwind code MUST be converted to match the target project's technology stack and styling system.\n1. Analyze the target codebase to identify: technology stack, styling approach, component patterns, and design tokens\n2. Convert React syntax to the target framework/library\n3. Transform all Tailwind classes to the target styling system while preserving exact visual design\n4. Follow the project's existing patterns and conventions\nDO NOT install any Tailwind as a dependency unless the user instructs you to do so.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Node ids have been added to the code as data attributes, e.g. `data-node-id=\"1:2\"`."},{"type":"text","text":"These styles are contained in the design: white: #FFFFFF, black: #000000, helvetica bold 16 0%: Font(family: \"Helvetica\", style: Bold, size: 16, weight: 700, lineHeight: 100, letterSpacing: 0)."},{"type":"text","text":"The generated code contains image and SVG URL constants, e.g. const image = `${assetPathPrefix}/<asset file name>`, where assetPathPrefix is declared once at the top of the code and every asset URL interpolates it. These URLs are temporary download sources and expire after 7 days. Download each asset into the project with curl -L, then replace its URL in the generated code with a reference to the downloaded asset. Never use the temporary URLs as runtime image sources."},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}],"structuredContent":null,"isError":false}
